&lt;li&gt;Advise the team on the evolving AI/BI tooling landscape (Rovo, Atlassian Intelligence, embedded AI), helping decide when to build versus when to consume.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and mentor junior analysts, championing data best practices so outputs remain clean and consistent as tool access broadens.&lt;/li&gt;
