&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We&#39;re&amp;nbsp;a small, senior team working on hard problems with clients who are serious about deploying AI in production. The work is hands-on, the ownership is real, and the leadership you exercise here will directly shape what this team becomes.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;This is early.&amp;nbsp;You&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;have meaningful input into the strategy, the team, and what Harbor Labs grows into.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
